Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

Hi team,

Before go-live, the portal must meet the following:

1. Multi-factor authentication for every policyholder login.
2. Policyholders may only ever see their own policies and documents.
3. Card data must never be stored or processed in Salesforce. Use the hosted payment page.
4. Personal data in the portal must be encrypted at rest.
5. All portal logins and renewal acceptances must be auditable for 7 years.
6. A penetration test is required before go-live.

Regards,
Information Security
